window.products.push({"id":311122,"name":"STONECREST Heated Recliner Cover, Water Resistant Print Recliner Slipcover, Stay in Place (Elegant Blues, Heated Recliner 23\" Regular)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UdK43eM1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This heated recliner chair cover using the silicone button switch that has 3 heat settings and features a 4-hour auto shut off. And including one home power adaptor, 12V Low Voltage output give you a safety and touchless feeling of the warming wire. This Low Voltage heated recliner cover the heating on both seat and back area, providing you a cozy warm on your back, hips and thighs when you seat in the cold winter. This Heated recliner slipcover has SIX sizes- 23” Regular Small, 25” Regular Middle, 25” Regular & Deep Seat Middle, 34\" Regular Oversized & Deep Seat, 28” T-Cushion & Deep Seat and 34” T-Cushion Oversized. Please see the below Style and Size Guide in A+ before the purchase. This print recliner chair cover is made of water resistant polyester printed fabric which offers you softness, comfortable feeling and water/staining resistant. And the printed pretty pattern adds more luxurious and stylish to your furniture. The package includes one heated recliner slipcover, one home power adapter, and two user manuals - one for recliner cover setup manual, one for the heating operation manual. Please read these two user Manuals before use and if you have any questions or concerns of this Low Voltage heated recliner chair cover, please contact to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UdK43eM1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STONECREST Classic Home Decor, Inc","source_asin":"B0BMFBNHYX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMFBNHYX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMFBNHYX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":311123,"name":"KMU Small Desk Fan with Night Light Desktop Fan Rechargeable 4000mAh Battery Operated Fan Personal Table ​Fan for Room Bedroom Office...","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iuOw5o+PL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"1. Desk fan with LED night light, two lighting modes are optional: multi-color automatic gradient and custom color light continuously on. 2. The night light can work alone, and the right button is the light control button. Short press once to turn on the light, at this time the light is in multi-color automatic gradient mode, long press for 2 seconds to lock the light color, and long press again to unlock the light color. 3. The small oscillating fan can swing back and forth automatically within 120° in the horizontal direction, just press the middle button.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iuOw5o+PL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KMU","source_asin":"B09328K78P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09328K78P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09328K78P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":311124,"name":"Be My Valentine Set of 4 Lori Mitchell Collectible Figurines","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418lqZWllML._AC_.jpg","description":"Get all of the new 2021 Lori Mitchell Figurine in this little set of 4 designs. Featured you'll find \"Light my Fire\", \"Sucker for You\", \"Collecting Hearts\" and \"Heartbreaker\" Each comes individually boxed. Design By: Lori C. Mitchell Material: Painted Poly Resin Size each approximately 5.5\"- 6\" Material: Hand painted resin Occasion: Valentine's Day Originality: Original Weight: 1.00 LBS ABOUT US: Almost everything we sell is handmade or designed in America. We are so proud to represent such amazing and talented artists…there have been over 1,400 through the years! Unique handcrafted works from over 400 artisans from throughout the United States are on display. Fall in love with these darling pieces! Designed by Lori, In Lori’s signature style, Figures are adorned in traditional folk art patterns and motifs while a blissfully happy expression graces its adorable face. The delightful duo poses atop an intricately hand painted figure that perfectly complements the scene of love. One of the featured artists for The Kinks & Quirks is Lori Mitchell . Lori Mitchell was born and raised in Marietta, Georgia. She is a graduate of the Rhode Island School of Design. Lori finds inspiration in old illustrations, children’s tales and anything whimsical. In 1998, she discovered folk art, and fell in love with the charm and nostalgia that this field embraces. Lori creates pieces that take people back to the magical years of childhood. In designing, Lori starts off with an idea, but as she sculpts, the characters begin to define their own personality. Lori is known for her exaggerated proportions and expressions…and every piece must have crazy socks!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418lqZWllML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kinks & Quirks","source_asin":"B0842VC5S1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842VC5S1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842VC5S1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
