window.products.push({"id":311265,"name":"Set of 2 under bed shoe storage - ALL 4 SIDES IS STURDY- drawers,Closet Box Organizer Natural Canvas with See-Through Top, Brown Trim, Size: 23 ½’’ x ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G0opR5q8L._AC_.jpg","description":"It’s Time to Get Those Shoes Organized with the OrganizeCity Shoe Storage Solution! Gone are the days when people only owned one or two pairs of shoes.Nowadays we all must have hundreds of pairs of shoes floating around our closets, front hallways, bedrooms, and even on the back porch!Crocs, boots, sandals, flats, loafers, dress shoes, heels, etc.…That’s not even mentioning children’s shoes that seem to find their way into the strangest places!Instead of letting everything get jumbled together, it’s time to organize your home by storing your shoes in this sturdy, smart under bed storage system! GENERAL FEATURES: 👍 Premium Quality – Made of a non-woven canvas fabric for extra protection.The sturdy construction means your shoe storage case will hold its form and shoes in place.👍 Stackable – The sturdy design means you can even stack these shoe bags one on top of the other.This looks neat and organized, making you feel calm and in control of the shoes.👍 Breathable Fabric – The breathable fabric keeps shoes dust free and odor free even when in storage for a long time.👍 Strong Zippers & Handles – Strong zippers give you superior protection and easy access to your shoe collection.The strong handles give you the option to pull the shoe bag out from under your bed or from a shelf.👍 2-Pack for Extra Space - More slots for more shoes – 12 slots in each bag!Store up to 24 shoes you don’t wear as often or that aren’t in season under your bed.👍 Stores Flat – When not in use, you can fold these up flat and slide them into any closet or leave them under your bed. Specifications: ✔ Size: 23 ½’’ x 29 ½’’ x 5’’✔ Reinforced sides ✔ Easy to clean, stain resistant lining. Get Yours Today - Your home will look clean, clear and uncluttered without piles of shoes getting underfoot!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G0opR5q8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OrganizeCity","source_asin":"B01G28VWSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G28VWSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G28VWSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
