window.products.push({"id":311304,"name":"Poster Woman with A Head of Roses. Salvadore Dali. Art Print Reproduction (16.2in x 21.5in),Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JcteSAYnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The famous Spanish surrealist painter, Salvador Dali had an artistic repertoire that included sculpture, painting, photography, multimedia work, and collaborations with other artists, most notably independent surrealist films. Woman with a Head of Roses was created in 1935 in Zurich. Oil on wood, 35 x 27 cm. Dali often replaced the human head with other heads or objects. He dislikes the lack of intelligence and excess of perfumes of rich people around the surrealist group. This print will make a great addition to your home or office decor. Bold colors make it an accent piece. Printed on the high-quality thick poster paper, it will please your eyes for years to come. Also, this poster has a white trim around it. You can cut it off and it will perfectly suit a standard 16x20 frame, or you may order the custom frame that suits you the most.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JcteSAYnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poster Station","source_asin":"B00PVN4TRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PVN4TRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PVN4TRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
