window.products.push({"id":311318,"name":"PLUWEL Flame Aroma Diffuser Humidifier,Auto-Off 300ml Essential Oil Diffuser for Large Room, Adjustable Brightness Air Humidifier with Timer for Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dTQH418lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FLAME HUMIDIFIER】The flame diffuser humidifier integrate with a built-in smart LED light that collects light and mist to create a realistic flame effect, adding a relax,soothe,calm atmosphere to your room. 【FLAME DIFFUSER FOR LARGE ROOM】 This Fire humidifiers for bedroom has larger water tank capacity 300 ML compared to other flame diffuser claims 180ml or less, can work up to 15 hours, ideal essential oil diffusers for home large room. 【STRIKING DESIGN】With a compact, convenient, portable design, our flame humidifier is coated by high-end texture finish, with elegant flower pattern and warm ambient light effect, giving you pleasing atmosphere for you to relax. 【QUIET OPERATION MOOD】The aroma diffuser featuring an ultra-quiet operation mood of 30dB peaceful environment to help soothe your mood, relieve stress, improve your sleep quality. 【3 TIMER SETTING & AUTO SHUT-OFF】Our Aroma humidifier has pre-set with 3 timer mode(1H,3H and 6H) by press the “light” button. And the auto shut off function, help the flame diffuser to stop working once lack of water, making it very safe and reliable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dTQH418lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PLUWEL","source_asin":"B0BP28RYRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP28RYRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP28RYRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":311319,"name":"GEAYAZE Adhesive Hooks, 33 Pcs Transparent Removable Small Sticky Hooks, Heavy Duty Adhesive Wall Hooks 10 lbs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cv8QIyYML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Adhesive Wall Hooks: (1) Easy to use: Direct paste, no tools, no screws, no drilling, no damage to walls. Simple and easy, save time and effort. (2) Easy to remove: After heating the sticky hook with a hair dryer, it can be easily removed. (3) 160° rotation design: More widely used, they can be used in many places. (4) Water & Oil proof: Ideal for hanging shower or bath accessories or kitchen utensils and tools. (5) Heavy duty self adhesive hook: With a maximum load of 10 lbs, our heavy duty wall hook can hang more items. (6) Rugged and durable: Made of sturdy stainless steel and PVC materials to ensure high quality and durability. (7) 1 set 33 sticky adhesive hooks: Good adhesive wall hooks are never enough, Too many places in the home need it! How to use it correctly: Please stick it on a clean, flat, smooth surface, such as ceramic tile, marble, glass, stainless steel, wood, metal or plastic etc;  Please Do not Stick on Wallpapered, Painted, Damaged Walls and Rough Surfaces; Please do not use in high temperature environment (no more than 156℉);  Please do not hang valuable, fragile and overweight items. How to install: (1) Clean the walls with a towel to make sure the surface is clean, dry, free of dust and oil. (2) Gently tear off the adhesive protective film, do not touch the adhesive surface. (3) Stick it on the wall and squeeze out the air inside. (4) We suggest you to use the adhesive hook about 12 hours later after you stick it if you want to hang some heavy items. Trust us, it's worth it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cv8QIyYML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEAYAZE","source_asin":"B0B1QPWT7P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1QPWT7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1QPWT7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
