window.products.push({"id":311447,"name":"Eco-Ancheng Armless Accent Chair Cover Slipcover Stretch Spandex Slipper Chair Cover Removable Washable for Armless Chair Slipcover Furniture Protecto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fabIN18sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIZE:Eco-Ancheng armless chair slipcover suitable for most slipper chair:armless accent chair cover slipcover fit slipper chair size back length: 54.6-64.8cm/21.5-25.5 inch,back height(above seat): 33-43.1cm/13-17inch,back thickness: 12.5-17.8cm/5-7 inch,seat length: 53.3-58.4cm/21-23inch,seat width: 46.4-56.5cm/18.25-22.25 inch,seat thickness: 22.9-27.9cm/9-11inch.Please check the measurement guide in the item picture before order. MATERIAL:Armless chair slipcover quality fabric,Polyester and armless chair covers for accent chairs spandex,breathable and comfort to touch while keep wear-resistant and durable.Accent chair covers without arms stretchable fabric turns your accent wing chair into a fire-new look without any trouble. FUNCTION: Eco-Ancheng Armless chair slipcover protect your accent slipper chair from food and drink spills, pet hair and messy with our armless chair cover that are conveniently machine washable,make your furniture armless accent slipper chair stays looking like new.Slipper chair slipcover is easy to install and take off,armless chair covers a great partner for household life. MULTIPLE CHOICES:Armless accent chair cover various patterns give your armless accent sipper chair for living room a new look.Note:Because the light and individually difference between different computer screen resolution,the modern slipper chair slipcover color showed in screen may slightly different from the actual one.If you encounter problems during the armless chair slipcover installation process,please feel free to contact us,we will send you the chair covers installation video. Package Include:Armless chair slipcovers for accent chairs * 1pc.Easy to care: Eco-Ancheng accent chairs covers no arms can be installed and cleaned easily. Single armless sofa couch cover Machine Wash with cold, Do Not Bleach, Tumble Dry Low, No Ironing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fabIN18sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eco-Ancheng","source_asin":"B0BZCPR2CT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZCPR2CT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZCPR2CT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":311448,"name":"Palazzo 29 Inch Saddle Bar Stool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+3HAdnK-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Sous Vide - Your Culinary Game Changer Sous vide is a method of cooking that makes it super simple to achieve professional-quality results at home. The immersion circulator utilizes accurate time temperature control to deliver super-juicy, flavor-packed meals, every time. Professional chefs and restaurants started to rely on this immersion circulator since 10 years ago. Why Choose Our Sous Vide Cooker? Cooking Meat and Seafood. The ability of sous vide cooking to accurately control the temperature of the water, and hence the food being cooked in it, it slowly cooks your protein from edge to edge, you can avoid both the drying out and overcooking of the meat; and Seafood. Tastier. Retain all the juices that provide flavor, this is why when you order steaks at a restaurant they are so moist, juicy and tender. Food Safety. Food that is cooked sous vide is pasteurized and safe from foodborne contaminants caused by biological pathogens. Consistently good results. Sous vide cooking avoids the need for you to time things just right. You can focus on another task, no more undercooked, chewy or burnt food. Great For The Multi­tasking Cook. Sous vide cooker allow you have a bigger window of time to play with if you are multi­tasking in the kitchen. Conventional cooking is much less forgiving. Waste reduction. Traditionally prepared food dries out and results in waste. Food cooked via cooking, loses none of its volume. Cooking Steps Are Much Easier Than You Might Think 1.Attach your sous vide cooker to a pot, set the time and temperature according to your desired level of doneness. 2.Put your food in a sealed bag and clip it to the side of the water pot. 3.Finish by searing, grilling, or broiling the food to add a crispy, golden exterior layer.Finish by searing, grilling, or broiling the food to add a crispy, golden exterior layer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+3HAdnK-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALAHA","source_asin":"B00S1W6RU6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S1W6RU6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S1W6RU6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
