window.products.push({"id":311478,"name":"Mother Culture - Kefir/Reculturable (1-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WDj2O4itL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"Kefir a discovery ... Let it Seduce you! Kefir is the oldest fermented milk known to mankind. Its name was originated from a turkish vocabulary - Keif, which means pleasing sensation. It was originally produced in the Caucasian mountains. There is saying that consumption of Kefir was responsible for longevity of the natives of this region. Kefir is known for its special and valiant health properties. Today's scientific results have demonstrated the various health properties of this traditional artisinal food. Make kefir yourself... Instructions: 1. Heat 1 to 2 litres (3-4lb) of milk to 82ºC (180ºF) and cool to 21-24ºC (70-75ºF). 2. Add the content of the envelope and mix well. 3. Pour the inoculated milk into the airtight container. Let incubate into the YOGOTHERM at room temperature until curdling occurs (~ 24 hours). 4.Remove the container from the incubator and refrigerate. Shake before serving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WDj2O4itL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cheesemaking.com","source_asin":"B00DH0MHT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DH0MHT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DH0MHT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
