window.products.push({"id":311688,"name":"MacoHome Haze Blue Window Curtain Linen Privacy Customized Large Extra Width Panels for Living Room, not Full Blackout(Haze Blue, Custom Size)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yDDa5LkfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🌸 【Size】Curtains can be custom made. Pls email customer service. The option is used to make up the price difference of customization order. It's also the option of samples. 🌸 【Top Construction】 Silver(plastic material) grommet top fit curtain rods up to 1.5\" inch (Please contact customer service to make up the difference if you need Pleated Top/Rod Pocket/Tab Top/Back Tab/Plain Hook) 🌸 【Not Full Blackout】 Block out 65%-85% of the lights 🌸 【Easy Care】 Machine wash in cold water with similar colors; Tumble dry low; Do not bleach 🌸 【SIZE SUGGESTION】 For Grommet Top - at least 1.5-2 times the width of your curtain rod; For Pleated Top - 12\" longer than the curtain rod","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yDDa5LkfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MacoHome","source_asin":"B07NPKMYDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NPKMYDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NPKMYDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":311689,"name":"'MSC International Strawberry Huller","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KdIrOGh8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Strawberry HullerStainless steel strawberry huller, removes the top leaves from strawberries. I guess you could also call this utensil a strawberry stem tool, stem remover, or leaf puller. Anyway it's a handy gadget, better than using a knife because it removes just the stem without cutting off the top of the strawberry. Made in China by Bright Idea, quality is good. About 2-1/2\" long.Pricing: $.67 each or buy 10 for $6Recipe for strawberry shortcake: Wash and hull 2 pints of berries, mash them up with around 1/2 cup sugar (how much sugar to use depends on how sweet the berries are.) Let these stand while you prepare the shortcake. In a bowl mix 2 cups of all-purpose flour with 1 tablespoon sugar, 1 tablespoon baking powder, and 1/2 teaspoon salt. Cut in 1/2 cup shortening (soft butter or margarine) until the mixture is course, then add about 1/2 cup milk until mixture becomes a soft dough. Knead on a floured surface, about 8 or 10 times, then pat into an 8\" round cake pan, greased. Bake at 400 degrees 15 or 20 minutes until golden. When done, slice the shortcake in half with a long knife so you have two 8\" round pieces, a top and a bottom. Layer half the strawberries onto the bottom shortcake, put the top on, then layer on the rest of the berries, and top with whipped cream. Makes a beautiful strawberry shortcake dessert.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KdIrOGh8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MSC International","source_asin":"B0006VB23W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006VB23W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006VB23W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":311690,"name":"Scented Candle Simmering Cider (Apple Cinnamon), 7 oz, Glass Jar, Soy/Beeswax","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41r+wTYndnL._AC_.jpg","description":"What does this scent smell like? It's obviously difficult to explain in words the experience you will get from our scented candles, so the easy way out here would be to highlight this fragrance has been composed by Wild Berry Incense, the renowned traditional maker of incense sticks and cones.But that only tells you about the great quality - and not so much about the scent itself. So, let me give it a try anyway:Picture yourself in on a long Winter evening, near a pot of simmering apple cider with cinnamon sticks added. That's the fragrance experience this candle provides; it's not as intense as if you had your nose right in that pot, though - more like being in the same room. Burn Time: Typically 35 hours; depends on: Amount and intensity of drafts in the room Amount and intensity of drafts in the room At which size you keep the wick trimmed At which size you keep the wick trimmed surrounding temperature surrounding temperature .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41r+wTYndnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BW","source_asin":"B07HX6TMGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HX6TMGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HX6TMGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
