window.products.push({"id":311709,"name":"Hamilton Beach 25325 MealMaker Express Contact Grill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nJOOkErjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product description This Hamilton Beach Indoor Double Grill has 185 sq. in. of grilling space with two ways to grill - close the lid to grill food on both sides or open flat for large meals. Grids are removable and dishwasher safe. Fat drips away from food as it cooks providing low-fat, quick meals. Most meats grill in ten minutes or less. Features auto shutoff timer and removable, dishwasher safe drip tray. Amazon.com Steaks, burgers, hot dogs, fish, pork chops, French toast, sandwiches, hash browns, vegetables... The list goes on and on of foods and meals this compact countertop grill can cook on both sides simultaneously. A recipe booklet makes that clear, and even shows how a version of beef stroganoff can be prepared between the grill's top and bottom cooking grids in minutes. When the whole family sits down for a meal, or hungry friends turn up, the top opens flat, doubling the cooking surface to 216 square inches. (Each grid's effective cooking surface measures about 12-1/2 by 7 inches; closed, the grill--made of hard, bright, black plastic--measures 16-1/2 by 13 inches overall.) Other fine features: fats drain into dishwasher-safe drip tray for healthful cooking; timer shuts off grill automatically when cooking time elapses; dishwasher-safe, nonstick grids remove for easy cleanup; and cord wraps into bottom for storage. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nJOOkErjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B00004SPE0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SPE0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SPE0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":311710,"name":"BEW Large Wall Clocks for Living Room Decor, Silent Battery Operated Wall Clock, 24 Inch White Rustic Country Farmhouse Shiplap Round Wooden Wall Cloc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OcbyvdtzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Track Time : It is wise to keep a clock in the living room for the management of time. Missing an appointment is a common issue for people who don’t know how to manage time. Hanging a white rustic wall clock in living room not only practical but also aesthetic. Quick Install or Move : If you value flexibility, BEW battery clocks bring further benefits. Large wooden wall clocks battery operated, you can moving the wood clock from living room to office simply means taking it off the wall, without any wires to disconnect and reconnect. No Sound, No Interference : Are you still using a analog wall clock with a \"tick-tock\" sound? Annoying ticks are distracting, and it's time to switch to a non-ticking silent wall clock. This quiet wall clock is energy efficient, completely mute, and won't disturb you when installed anywhere. Rustic Country Vibe : In addition to warning you of time, the large wall clock can also enhance the beauty of your home. What better way to inject the rustic than with a wood wall clock? With its rustic retro appeal, this 24 inch large wood wall clock will looks great in farmhouse style living room, office, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen. As Perfect Gift : Friend bought a new house and you are confused about what to gift for their housewarming function? New homes have a lot of empty spaces and boring walls, why not choose a large home decorative clock? Nothing can beat the utility and charm of a rustic farmhouse wall clock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OcbyvdtzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEW","source_asin":"B0BRK7C6J2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRK7C6J2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRK7C6J2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
