window.products.push({"id":311821,"name":"Travel Salt And Pepper Grinder Set, Grind Gourmet Original Pump & Grind Salt and Pepper Push It, Spice Grinder (Clear)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vuEwqSyvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SALT AND PEPPER ON THE GO Grind Gourmet’s Original travel size salt and pepper grinder is great they fit in your purse, vehicle, boat, camping gear, office desk, backpack… Each mini salt pepper grinder set comes with it’s own stand, travel pouch and a sample size packet of sea salt and pepper to allow you to enjoy a healthy meal in an instant. Select from our signature polycarbonate set or stainless steel salt pepper grinder set. FORM AND FUNCTION EXQUISITELY PAIRED Grind Gourmet is the creator of the Original Pump & Grind salt and pepper grinder set. Similar looking mills on the market are evidence of Grind Gourmet’s success however Grind Gourmet mills are made with a superior quality stainless steel, the core is solid steel not plastic so pressure from grinding will not cause the mill to break. Once you use these mills you’ll never want to be without them. Enjoy our environmentally friendly pepper grinders. FREE UP ONE HAND with Grind Gourmet’s Original Herb Grinder. Whether you are adding Himalayan sea salt or peppercorns to a dish/recipe these salt and pepper grinders easily do the job. Our one handed pepper mill and salt grinder will allow you to grind some fresh sea salt seasoning onto a hard-boiled egg or burrito while holding it with the free hand because thumb salt and pepper grinders do the work conventional two-hand operated salt and pepper mills require. EASY TO USE EASY TO REFILL Operating our one handed pepper grinder is easy if my grandmother can use it so can you! Using our mills helps to keep your muscles in good shape. Put the battery-powered grinder aside keep your texting thumbs in good shape! To refill our mills we suggest keeping salt and pepper in freezer sized bags in your pantry to easily scoop pepper into the pepper grinder and salt into the salt mill. WE STAND BEHIND OUR PRODUCTS Every purchase is backed by a no-questions-asked policy we want you happy so in the unlikely event of a complication we’ll be around to assist you. We created the Original Pump & Grind in 2000 with the highest quality stainless steel to prevent rust and wear. You get what you pay for with Grind Gourmet products! We have offered the best salt and pepper grinders for almost two decades now there is a reason for that, we’ll be around should you need us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vuEwqSyvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grind Gourmet","source_asin":"B073X8ZHVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073X8ZHVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073X8ZHVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
