window.products.push({"id":311894,"name":"Certified 100 % Long Staple Pure Organic Egyptian Cotton 1200 Thread Count Luxury Soft Silky Sateen Weave -18”Deep Pockets - Easy Fit -Breathable & Wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":160.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j4iwr0w3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SLEEP LIKE A CHILD} Who loves the cozy sleeping experience at a Luxury hotel? Sleep like a baby and wake up with full energy? We do! Aurora Plus specializes in the softest sheets & luxurious bedding. Silky soft, it is the most comfortable and luxurious bed sheets you can find. Have a toddler at home? Our trusted Egyptian cotton sheets give your baby healthy and dreaming bedtime every single night DEEP POCKET SHEETS WITH EXTRAORDINARY FIT: Crafted to keep you cool in warm weather and cozy during cooler months, these heavy yet breathable sheets are ideal for all seasons. Each 4 piece Queen bed set has 1 flat sheet (94\" W x 102\" L), 1 fitted sheet (60\" W x 80\" L + 18\" deep pocket) and 2 Standard / Queen pillowcases (21\" W x 32\" L). The all around elastic of the fitted sheet ensures a snug fit, preventing it from bunching up while you slip into a peaceful slumber. 【SAY BYE TO THE CHEAP SHEETS】We love soft and comfortable pure white bedlinen! Topline products - Certified Standard 100% by Pure Egyptian Cotton Sheets, Free from Harmful dyes and chemicals. The cotton absorbs and draws moisture away from your body and keeps you dry all night long. Bedlinen in cotton is very soft and pleasant to sleep in and has a pronounced luster that makes it look beautiful on your bed. 【Easy to Care】Thread count indicates the number of threads per square inch of fabric. The higher the thread count the more densely woven the fabric. Aurora Plus Pure Egy cotton sheets are MACHINE WASHABLE, wrinkle-free! Our product is suitable for use in smaller hotels, inns, and B&Bs as the design and material are optimized for frequent use and washing. Our sheets get softer with each wash, lifetime softness, and resist fading, and eco-friendly! 【Great Sheet for the PRICE】Unlike another microfiber sheet in the market, we only want pure cotton on our bed! It is the BEST PRICE for unrivaled breathability, and our pure cotton sheet provides an aura of chilling comfort and a peaceful night's rest. Our excellent 24/7 customer service team cares about your shopping experience. Make it yours! [IN-HOUSE QUALITY ASSURANCE ] Our entire production unit, cotton fields, supply chain, employee working conditions are put to a rigorous testing periodically. We are proud to be GOTS Certified (A must have certification for any Organic Product), OEKO Tex, BCI certified (We ensure a fair price to the farmers , adequate wages for workers, industry standard labor practices and community engagements). [100% ORGANIC MANUFACTURE ] 100% Organic Cotton procured directly from farmers to make this beautiful sheet set in-house. This sheet set is made using Percale Weave, which gives the sheet Crisp and Cool Attributes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j4iwr0w3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AURORA PLUS","source_asin":"B09F3V533Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F3V533Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F3V533Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
