window.products.push({"id":311900,"name":"Georg Jensen Beak Thermal Coffee Carafe, 1 L, Stainless Steel with ABS Plastic Stopper, Thermal Pots for Coffee and Tea, Thermo Jug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vc0NGQbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT AND FUNCTIONAL: With a shape inspired by the stately figure of an emperor penguin, the Beak Thermo jug has a sleek and elegant silhouette, a functional nature and a touch of humour, making it the perfect talking point in any table setting. Its almost aerodynamic look is not only about aesthetics - the thermos has been designed to be easy to pour with no dripping or spills and the push button on the top controls the flow of liquid. HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL: All the stainless steel products are hand-polished, which is rather time consuming process performed by only the most skilled craftsmen. UNIQUE AND DISTINCT DESIGNER: Born in 1961, Maria Berntsen studied at the Academy of Art in Copenhagen and L’Ecole d’Architecture de Bordeaux and finished her studies in 1992. Turning her talents to a wide range of products, Maria has produced some of the house's best loved pieces - from the ever popular Christmas Classics Advent and Season candlesticks to the charming Beak collection. Functional but quirky, her work continues to stand the test of time. CARE: Not dishwasher safe. Please clean using mild soapy water, follwered by a rinse in hot water. Stubborn stains caused by coffee and tea can be removed by using a solution of water and baking powder/bicarbonate of soda. Do not use cleaning solutions containing bleach or chlorine. Use only brushes with soft bristles or a soft cloth for cleaning. GEORG JENSEN: Renowned for innovation in art and design, Georg Jensen was established in Copenhagen in 1904, quickly becoming the preeminent silversmith with the creation of the original exclusive holloware and jewelry collections. Behind each remarkable Georg Jensen object is a lifetime of innovative art and design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vc0NGQbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Georg Jensen","source_asin":"B00BT86PQ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-311900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BT86PQ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BT86PQ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
